// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Huxley_Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KoraHarvest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2285123453" "Kora Fruit"
// DetailString :
"P918034618" "You've gathered these Kora fruit for Dr. Huxley"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3510816597" "Well, um, hmmm. There's so much to do, let me think. Ah, I know! Kora Fruit! That's what I'm researching, and I think you might find them pretty helpful, too. Kora fruit are one of the most exciting things we've discovered, at least from a biomedical and pharmceutical perspective. The difficulty lies in getting samples, since they're often guarded by the Rularuu. So, how about while I figure out what I'm going to need your help with, you speak with Miss Moore over there? She's sort of a leader among the natives, and she's been a big help with all kinds of things out here. She's actually the one who first brought Kora Fruit to our attention. <br><br>Personally, I think she also has a bit of a crush on Lt. Col. Flynn."
// AcceptString :
"P1241504547" "Speak with Sara Moore"
// SendOffString :
"P244412448" "Miss Moore's right over there. She should be able to explain a good deal about the Kora Fruit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Huxley_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3462410146" "In the name of all of the People of Paragon, I greet you, great {HeroName}. I have heard of your might and power from others of the people, and from the expedition. It is an honor to meet you. <br><br>I was the first to tell the expedition of the Kora Fruit. I brought some to explorers who were in danger from the Rularuu, and with them saved lives. Ever since I saved Lieutenant Colonel Flynn and his men that day, I have worked to help the expedition and my own people. <br><br>By our tales, our people have used the Kora Fruit since before the madness broke the world. Kora Fruit come from Kora Vines, which feed on the red water of the Cascades in deep caves. Each kind of Kora Fruit gives a great boon to those who taste of it; healing, restoring energy, or even making one fight better. Our people have survived much thanks to the Kora. However, the Kora also draw the Rularuu in great numbers. It is not known why, for they do not eat of it, but merely guard it. <br><br>{HeroName}, I know that you are busy with great works now, but if you speak with me again later I have a task that requires a great force of mighty heroes to accomplish."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Huxley_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P484559623" "Speak with Dr. Huxley"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P346404460" "Oh, well, how about you talk to me?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P103548912" "As Miss Moore no doubt explained, one of the big difficulties with researching Kora Fruit is that the Rularuu are also attracted to it. This makes it hard to get samples. It's one of the more dangerous things that the natives do to survive. Well, on that note, how about I ask you to help get a small sample of Kora Fruit for me? Miss Moore's people recently found a small cave with some Kora fruit that only recently's been overtaken by the Rularuu, so it shouldn't be that difficult to reach them. <br><br>Now remember, when you pick a Kora fruit it will give you an inspiration, so keep some space open to receive it."
// RandomFameString :
"P2216604259" "I saw something about an amazing fruit with healing properties in the Shadow Shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Huxley_Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1077410295" "Get Kora Fruit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4011858244" "You should be able to find some Kora Fruit in this cave without drawing too much attention from the Rularuu."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1266397743" "The cave is both warm and slightly damp inside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - KoraBlue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3929103260" "Kora Vine"
// Description :
"P737178776" "Kora vine"
// SingularDescription :
"P1270988514" "1 Kora vine"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2508299342" "You begin to harvest the strange blue fruit"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3704905148" "You have harvested the Kora fruit"
// InteractActionString :
"P4120017167" "Harvesting..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3683260229" "You received an inspiration!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - KoraGreen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractBeginString :
"P107312256" "You begin to harvest the strange green fruit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P336786116" "You harvested the Kora Fruit for Dr. Huxley."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4032864877" "Thank you, {HeroName}! These are perfect specimens. Now, whenever you pick a Kora fruit, you'll get one to use yourself. They act just like medium strength inspirations, so remember to keep enough free space for it, or it will be wasted. <br><br>Contact me any time you want to gather more Kora fruit. I'll always need more for study, and would be happy for the help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Huxley_Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KoraHarvest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P417214971" "My research into the Kora Fruit is coming along splendidly, but the Rularuu have taken notice and begun to post stronger guardians. I still need more Kora fruit for my work, and with the new guards Miss Moore's people are having trouble getting them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Miss Moore's people have found a small cave with a variety of ripe Kora fruit in it, but it's guarded by many Rularuu who'll have to be defeated prevent reprisals against us.</A> You'll still get some for yourself, of course, but you'll have to fight for them."
// AcceptString :
"P3948824209" "Gather Kora fruit an defeat the guardians in a small cave"
// SendOffString :
"P261058420" "Thank you for all of your help, {HeroName}. This will help my research a great deal. You will need to gather all of the Kora fruit and defeat the Kora vine's guardians in the depths of the cave to finish the expedition."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1281835015" "Gather Kora in small cave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4104828074" "The cave is warm and humid, like a hot-house for tropical flowers."

